{"id": "tgb:T8899197", "code": "002578", "name": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 10:20", "kind": "post", "author": "喵小曦", "title": "11.10 &lt;font color=&#39;#4793F1&#39;&gt;闽发铝业&lt;/font&gt; 出清", "content": "2-3&nbsp;&nbsp;转强&nbsp;太吸引人，&nbsp;东方系&nbsp;太强，&nbsp;&nbsp;跷跷板的&nbsp;资金关系&nbsp;都能看懂。低位强，高位就没有人了。&nbsp;［图片］", "praise": "", "view": "", "comment": "", "link": "", "src": "tgb.cn"}
